@cryptofanatiix Prompt engineers don’t really exist anymore, AI is much better at that now. Even if a new job is invented  it doesn’t take long before AI can do it better, faster and cheaper.

@jag_99 Bots can (and already do) earn money for their humans. They also pay each other. And there is a good chance money will disappear in a couple of years, but that’s a whole other can of worms.

@ssssssssselim There is basically unlimited demand, while supply is the bottleneck. That’s the opposite of a bubble.

